rders-db for request_id=req-8812"}],"details":{"meta":{"source":"/workspace/in/logs/orders-db.log","sourcePath":"/workspace/in/logs/orders-db.log"}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788158065202},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Mapping output paths and identifying incident ID**\n\n**Ensuring deterministic output with two files**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0eab343a111226bf016a952072480087d2b31dbf09184a8201\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"<PROVIDER_ENCRYPTED_PAYLOAD_REDACTED>\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Mapping output paths and identifying incident ID**\"},{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Ensuring deterministic output with two files**\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_8mucEmlR2bzhH3QSKiSRhXxC|fc_0eab343a111226bf016a9520763b3c87d2a64a0cf33381d505","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/workspace/out/root_cause.json","content":"{\n  \"incident_id\": \"req-8812\",\n  \"root_cause_service\": \"auth-gateway\",\n  \"root_cause_change_id\": \"AUTH-2026-0318\",\n  \"confidence\": \"high\",\n  \"affected_services\": [\n    \"checkout-web\",\n    \"payment-api\",\n    \"auth-gateway\"\n  ],\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\n      \"source_file\": \"/workspace/in/topology.json\",\n      \"observation\": \"The dependency path is checkout-web -> payment-api -> auth-gateway; AUTH-2026-0318 changed auth-gateway issuer and JWKS cache settings at 14:05Z.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_file\": \"/workspace/in/metrics/service_metrics.csv\",\n      \"observation\": \"At 14:10Z, checkout-web had an 18.7% HTTP 401 rate and 2400 ms p95, payment-api had a 21.2% HTTP 401 rate with notes citing an invalid issuer, and auth-gateway had a 28.4% HTTP 401 rate with issuer mismatch.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_file\": \"/workspace/in/logs/auth-gateway.log\",\n      \"observation\": \"After deployment of AUTH-2026-0318, auth-gateway used partner-v2 but allowed_issuers remained partner-v1; validation failed with issuer_not_allowed. The log names restoring partner-v2 or reverting the change as rollback candidates.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_file\": \"/workspace/in/logs/payment-api.log\",\n      \"observation\": \"payment-api rejected the request after auth-gateway returned issuer_not_allowed/invalid_issuer.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_file\": \"/workspace/in/logs/checkout-web.log\",\n      \"observation\": \"checkout-web submit_order failed with status 401 from payment-api, and the user checkout flow remained blocked while static assets recovered.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"excluded_red_herrings\": [\n    {\n      \"signal\": \"orders-db CPU at 86% during vacuum\",\n      \"why_not_primary\": \"Query p95 was 35 ms with zero errors, and no failing checkout transaction reached orders-db.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"signal\": \"cdn-edge HTTP 5xx rate of 4.8%\",\n      \"why_not_primary\": \"The errors were isolated to images; static assets served normally after retry, while checkout submits still failed on payment authentication.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"signal\": \"checkout-web and payment-api latency/5xx increases\",\n      \"why_not_primary\": \"These are downstream effects of repeated authentication rejection, not evidence of a database or frontend availability cause.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"recommended_next_steps\": [\n    \"Immediately roll back AUTH-2026-0318 or correct auth-gateway allowed_issuers to include partner-v2, following change control.\",\n    \"Refresh or invalidate the affected JWKS cache namespace and confirm partner-v2 keys and issuer configuration agree.\",\n    \"Verify a partner-token validation succeeds at auth-gateway, then a create_payment request succeeds at payment-api, then an end-to-end checkout submit succeeds at checkout-web.\",\n    \"Monitor HTTP 401/5xx rates and p95 latency for checkout-web, payment-api, and auth-gateway; confirm no new issuer mismatch events.\"\n  ]\n}\n"}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-luna","usage":{"input":2017,"output":991,"cacheRead":14848,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":191,"totalTokens":17856,"cost":{"input":0.00040340000000000005,"output":0.0011891999999999998,"cacheRead":0.00029696000000000003,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00188956}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788158065204,"responseId":"resp_0eab343a111226bf016a9520718c5087d2a1357992be5c9696","rawStopReason":"completed"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_8mucEmlR2bzhH3QSKiSRhXxC|fc_0eab343a111226bf016a9520763b3c87d2a64a0cf33381d505","toolName":"write","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[out/root_cause.json#B9BC]\nSuccessfully wrote 2848 bytes to /workspace/out/root_cause.json"}],"details":{"resolvedPath":"/workspace/out/root_cause.json"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788158084256},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_96hgYsUgCt2XHp2V7x2V3LZV|fc_0eab343a111226bf016a952085655487d2b82cf0f4d1604423","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/workspace/out/triage_notes.md","content":"# Checkout incident triage\n\n## Finding\n\n**Directly observed facts:** The checkout request `req-8812` failed with HTTP 401 at `checkout-web`, which received the failure from `payment-api` (`/workspace/in/logs/checkout-web.log`). `payment-api` recorded `issuer_not_allowed` from `auth-gateway` and rejected payment creation (`/workspace/in/logs/payment-api.log`). `auth-gateway` deployed `AUTH-2026-0318` at 14:05Z, selected issuer `partner-v2`, then rejected it because only `partner-v1` was allowed (`/workspace/in/logs/auth-gateway.log`).\n\n**Inferred root cause:** `AUTH-2026-0318` left the auth gateway's allowed-issuer configuration inconsistent with its new `partner-v2` issuer/JWKS namespace. This is the primary cause with high confidence because the failure starts after that change and the logs identify the exact mismatch.\n\n## Dependency path\n\nThe topology defines `checkout-web -> payment-api -> auth-gateway` (`/workspace/in/topology.json`). A checkout submit calls payment creation; payment authentication calls the auth gateway; the issuer mismatch causes auth rejection, payment rejection, and then user-visible checkout failure. Metrics support this path: at 14:10Z, HTTP 401 rates were 18.7% for checkout-web, 21.2% for payment-api, and 28.4% for auth-gateway (`/workspace/in/metrics/service_metrics.csv`).\n\nOrders-db was not on the failing request path after the auth gate. Its 86% CPU signal occurred during vacuum, but query p95 was 35 ms with no errors and the request did not reach it (`/workspace/in/logs/orders-db.log`). CDN image 5xx errors were isolated; assets recovered while checkout remained blocked (`/workspace/in/logs/checkout-web.log`). These are **directly observed facts**; the conclusion that they are red herrings is an **inference** from those facts and the dependency graph.\n\n## Immediate mitigation\n\n1. Under change control, revert `AUTH-2026-0318`, or update `allowed_issuers` to accept the intended `partner-v2` issuer as the auth log recommends.\n2. Refresh/invalidate the affected JWKS cache and confirm the `partner-v2` keys match the issuer configuration.\n3. Avoid disabling authentication or bypassing the payment auth gate.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Confirm a known-good partner token validates at `auth-gateway` with no `issuer_not_allowed` events.\n- Submit a payment through `payment-api`, then run an end-to-end checkout submit through `checkout-web`.\n- Check that 401/5xx rates and p95 latency return toward baseline for all three services, and that no new issuer mismatch events occur.\n- Confirm orders-db and CDN signals separately; neither should be used as the success criterion for the auth fix.\n"}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-luna","usage":{"input":2018,"output":651,"cacheRead":15872,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":18541,"cost":{"input":0.00040360000000000005,"output":0.0007812,"cacheRead":0.00031744,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0015022400000000002}},"